t Planning in Agile?</mattext></material><response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single"><render_choice><response_label ident="3001"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">To define deliverables for the upcoming sprint</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="3002"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">To finalize project requirements</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="3003"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">To conduct user testing</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="3004"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">To create extensive documentation</mattext></material></response_label></render_choice></response_lid></presentation><resprocessing><outcomes><decvar maxvalue="1" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" /></outcomes><respcondition continue="No"><conditionvar><varequal respident="response1">3001</varequal></conditionvar><setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">1</setvar></respcondition></resprocessing></item><item ident="Q4" title="Question 4"><itemmetadata><qtimetadata><qtimetadatafield><fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel><fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry></qtimetadatafield><qtimetadatafield><fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel><fieldentry>1</fieldentry></qtimetadatafield><qtimetadatafield><fieldlabel>assessment_question_identifierref</fieldlabel><fieldentry>i000004</fieldentry></qtimetadatafield></qtimetadata></itemmetadata><presentation><material><mattext texttype="text/html">How do Agile methods enhance responsiveness to user needs?</mattext></material><response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single"><render_choice><response_label ident="4001"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">By delivering functional software in shorter cycles</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="4002"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">By following a strict timeline</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="4003"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">By minimizing customer involvement</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="4004"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">By focusing on comprehensive documentation</mattext></material></response_label></render_choice></response_lid></presentation><resprocessing><outcomes><decvar maxvalue="1" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" /></outcomes><respcondition continue="No"><conditionvar><varequal respident="response1">4001</varequal></conditionvar><setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">1</setvar></respcondition></resprocessing></item><item ident="Q5" title="Question 5"><itemmetadata><qtimetadata><qtimetadatafield><fieldlabel>question_type</fieldlabel><fieldentry>multiple_choice_question</fieldentry></qtimetadatafield><qtimetadatafield><fieldlabel>points_possible</fieldlabel><fieldentry>1</fieldentry></qtimetadatafield><qtimetadatafield><fieldlabel>assessment_question_identifierref</fieldlabel><fieldentry>i000005</fieldentry></qtimetadatafield></qtimetadata></itemmetadata><presentation><material><mattext texttype="text/html">Which framework is commonly associated with Agile methods?</mattext></material><response_lid ident="response1" rcardinality="Single"><render_choice><response_label ident="5001"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">Scrum</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="5002"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">Waterfall</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="5003"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">V-Model</mattext></material></response_label><response_label ident="5004"><material><mattext texttype="text/plain">Spiral</mattext></material></response_label></render_choice></response_lid></presentation><resprocessing><outcomes><decvar maxvalue="1" minvalue="0" varname="SCORE" vartype="Decimal" /></outcomes><respcondition continue="No"><conditionvar><varequal respident="response1">5001</varequal></conditionvar><setvar action="Set" varname="SCORE">